WEBVTT

02:26:22.875 --> 02:26:25.042
When we got beaten because of him,

02:26:25.292 --> 02:26:26.834
we got angry with him.

02:26:28.625 --> 02:26:30.500
Now, in an attempt to get him caught,

02:26:31.459 --> 02:26:32.750
we got courage as well.

02:26:33.750 --> 02:26:36.250
He brought so many
changes in us unknowingly.
